  "refund-returns-policy": {
    "slug": "refund-returns-policy",
    "title": "Refund and Returns Policy",
    "url": "https://myhappyhour.co.ke/refund_returns/",
    "content": "<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ea21cbd e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"ea21cbd\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1758cb63 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1758cb63\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2d21d34 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2d21d34\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-84b5132 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"84b5132\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">MyHappyHour.co.ke Refund, Return, and Cancellation Policy</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b806fa2 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"b806fa2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-30c6fb5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"30c6fb5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This policy details the specific terms for order cancellations, product returns, and experience booking refunds.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d69eda4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d69eda4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">1. Order Cancellation (Physical Products)</h4>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9185915 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9185915\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Cancellation Window:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> You may request to cancel an order for a full refund </span><b>within 10 minutes</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> of placing it.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b style=\"font-style: inherit;\">Post-Processing Cancellation:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> After 10 minutes OR once the order has been handed to the assigned driver, a </span><b style=\"font-style: inherit;\">cancellation fee of 10%</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> of the order value will be deducted from your refund. If the order is in transit, the delivery fee will also be forfeited.</span></li>\n</ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e171773 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e171773\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">2. Returns for Physical Products (Drinks)</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-df71755 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"df71755\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All sales are generally final. We will only accept returns or offer a refund/replacement if you notify us </span><b>within 48 hours of delivery</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for the following verifiable conditions:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Damaged or Leaking Product</b></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Incorrect Item Delivered</b></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Defective/Spoiled Product (must be returned with a significant portion remaining).</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Non-Returnable Items: Change of mind, partially consumed products (unless defective), or products damaged after successful delivery.</span></li>\n</ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-12f55c5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"12f55c5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">3. Cancellations for Experiences &amp; Tickets</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-de2b7e2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"de2b7e2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><b>When You Cancel (Notice Period Before Event)</b></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><b>Refund/Credit Policy</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><b>8 days or more</b></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><b>100% Full Refund</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (or 100% Store Credit).</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><b>Between 7 days and 72 hours</b></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><b>50% cash refund OR 100% Store Credit</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><b>Less than 72 hours</b></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No Refund or Credit will be issued.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><b>Cancelled by MyHappyHour/Venue</b></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><b>100% full refund</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> or option to rebook for a future date.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8da1528 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8da1528\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">4. Refund Process</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-02f458a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"02f458a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Contact Customer Support within the specified timeframe. Refunds will be processed within 5–10 business days of item verification.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div> <!-- ast-container -->\n\t</div><!-- #content -->",
    "lastFetched": "2026-08-13T19:04:16.017Z"
  },
  "terms-conditions": {
    "slug": "terms-conditions",
    "title": "Terms & Conditions",
    "url": "https://myhappyhour.co.ke/terms-conditions/",
    "content": "<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-25bdd10 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"25bdd10\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5a7bce2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"5a7bce2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5c1872b e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5c1872b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a9c27d9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"a9c27d9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">MyHappyHour.co.ke General Terms and Conditions\n</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ae4b0ed elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"ae4b0ed\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e96cf8e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e96cf8e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Date of Last Revision: December 2025</h6>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f21c016 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f21c016\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>By accessing MyHappyHour.co.ke, placing an order, or booking an experience, you agree to be bound by these General Terms and Conditions and all referenced Sub-Policies listed in Section 5.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9cdf16c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9cdf16c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Acceptance and Eligibility</h4>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-077fe9b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"077fe9b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">1.1 Legal Drinking Age (Kenya Law)</h6>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e31e269 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e31e269\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>By using this site, you warrant that you are 18 years of age or older, which is the legal drinking age in Kenya.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-106657e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"106657e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">1.2 Age Verification</h6>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4e22fd8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4e22fd8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We reserve the right to request a valid National ID or Passport from the recipient upon delivery.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Mandatory Protocol:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Our delivery personnel are required to follow a mandatory, non-negotiable protocol which includes visually verifying the recipient&#8217;s age against a government-issued ID upon arrival.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If the recipient fails verification or is visibly intoxicated, the delivery will be cancelled. A partial refund (less a delivery and restocking fee of up to 20% of the order value) will be issued.</span></li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b6a5055 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b6a5055\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">1.3 Responsible Drinking</h6>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-116c4e6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"116c4e6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>MyHappyHour.co.ke advocates for responsible drinking.</p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">We reserve the right to set and enforce reasonable maximum quantity limits on orders.</li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">Our delivery staff are authorized to refuse delivery if the recipient is visibly intoxicated or displays unsafe behaviour./li&gt;</li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">We shall not be held liable for any misuse of the products or any resultant harm, damage, or incident.</li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-707ce1c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"707ce1c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">1.4 Order Placement and Acceptance</h6>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5c5b4fb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5c5b4fb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Your order is an offer to purchase. The contract is formed only when we send you a confirmation (via email/SMS) that your order has been accepted and dispatched.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cb69073 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"cb69073\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">2. Ordering and Payment</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9c5f490 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9c5f490\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">2.1 Pricing and Currency</h6>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6f720c2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6f720c2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All prices are listed in Kenyan Shillings (KES) and include applicable taxes (VAT) unless otherwise stated.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9b00fa1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9b00fa1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">2.2 Payment Methods</h6>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-223b4b6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"223b4b6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We accept payments via M-Pesa and major credit/debit cards (Visa/MasterCard) only. </span><b>Cash on Delivery (COD) is currently not accepted.</b></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-88015ef elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"88015ef\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">3. Disclaimers and Liability</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c8ec17a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c8ec17a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">3.1 Limitation of Liability</h6>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d0567c5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d0567c5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMyHappyHour.co.ke shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from the use or inability to use our service or products.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8904626 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8904626\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">3.2 Indemnity</h6>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f4b936b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f4b936b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>You agree to hold MyHappyHour.co.ke harmless from any claims, damages, or costs arising from your breach of these Terms, your misuse of the service, or your violation of any law or the rights of a third party.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ebd0250 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ebd0250\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">4. Governing Law and Dispute Resolution</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0f0788d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0f0788d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>These Terms and your use of the site are governed by the <b>laws of Kenya</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. Any dispute shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the Courts of Kenya.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bfb7460 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"bfb7460\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">5. Incorporated Sub-Policies</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1eecd08 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1eecd08\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The following policies contain specific, detailed terms and are fully incorporated into these General Terms and Conditions. </span></p><ol><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://myhappyhour.co.ke/refund_returns/\"><b>Refund, Return, and Cancellation Policy</b></a></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://myhappyhour.co.ke/delivery-policy/\"><b>Delivery Policy</b></a></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://myhappyhour.co.ke/privacy-policy/\"><b>Privacy Policy and Data Usage</b></a></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https://myhappyhour.co.ke/ugc-policy/\"><b>User Generated Content (UGC) Policy</b></a></li></ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div> <!-- ast-container -->\n\t</div><!-- #content -->",
    "lastFetched": "2026-08-13T19:04:18.808Z"
  },
