    "title": "Privacy Policy",
    "url": "https://myhappyhour.co.ke/privacy-policy/",
    "content": "<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d2e6211 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d2e6211\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-19f90f9 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"19f90f9\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-aec4296 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"aec4296\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d6e106c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d6e106c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">MyHappyHour.co.ke Privacy Policy and Data Usage</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-10c2ecd elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"10c2ecd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-135011a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"135011a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This policy details how your personal information is collected, used, and protected, in compliance with the </span><b>Kenyan Data Protection Act, 2019.</b></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-682cf4d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"682cf4d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">1. Data Collected</h4>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-033660f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"033660f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We collect contact details, order history, Date of Birth (DOB), and securely process payment details.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dbe7b76 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"dbe7b76\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">2. Use of Personal Data\n</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d172d01 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d172d01\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Your data is used for:</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Order fulfillment and age verification.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Improving your customer experience by delivering personalised engagement and curated offerings.</b></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Complying with legal obligations.</span></li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0c61460 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0c61460\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">3. Promotional and Marketing Consent</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9062fa9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9062fa9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You will be given a clear, separate option at checkout to </span><b>opt-in</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to receive promotional and marketing communications. Opting in grants MyHappyHour.co.ke consent to send you newsletters, deals, and personalized recommendations. Every communication will include a clear opt-out mechanism.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3625a75 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3625a75\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">4. Data Security</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-434295c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"434295c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We employ appropriate technical and organizational measures to secure your information and prevent unauthorized access.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c404fee elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c404fee\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">5. Cookie Notice</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8e7b7ef elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8e7b7ef\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We use cookies (small data files) to enhance your experience, analyze site traffic, and personalize content. Your continued use of the website constitutes consent to our use of cookies.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div> <!-- ast-container -->\n\t</div><!-- #content -->",
    "lastFetched": "2026-08-13T19:04:21.473Z"
  },
  "ugc-policy": {
    "slug": "ugc-policy",
    "title": "UGC Policy",
    "url": "https://myhappyhour.co.ke/ugc-policy/",
    "content": "<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c333324 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"c333324\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5d07fa4 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"5d07fa4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-54cb456 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"54cb456\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2548dc5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2548dc5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">MyHappyHour.co.ke User Generated Content (UGC) Policy</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4070c46 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"4070c46\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-afb8dd9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"afb8dd9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This policy governs the use of content you create and share related to MyHappyHour.co.ke.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-55dee97 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"55dee97\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">1. Grant of License and Acceptance</h4>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5616955 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5616955\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">By submitting, posting, or tagging MyHappyHour.co.ke in any content (on social media, our website, or at any official MyHappyHour physical event), you explicitly agree to these UGC terms and grant MyHappyHour.co.ke a perpetual, worldwide, royalty-free license to use, reproduce, and display your UGC in our marketing and promotional materials.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ff4483f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ff4483f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">2. Warranties (Third-Party IP Protection)</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-31b03d3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"31b03d3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You confirm you own the UGC or have secured all necessary rights and permissions from any third-party contributors (including photographers) to grant us this license.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-886d708 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"886d708\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">3. Responsible UGC</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1f24354 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1f24354\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">UGC must not promote excessive/irresponsible drinking or feature persons under the legal drinking age. We reserve the right to remove non-compliant content.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n</div><!-- .entry-content .clear -->\n\n\t\n\t\n</article><!-- #post-## -->",
    "lastFetched": "2026-08-13T19:04:24.121Z"
  },
